rd_slp1": "mAtra", "fold": "matra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "मात्र (I) a. (f. त्री or त्रा) An affix added to nouns to denote ‘measuring as much as,’ ‘reaching as far as’ e.g. ऊरुमात्र.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "मात्र (II) n. 1. Measure of any kind (either of height, breadth, time, space or number); (in this sense, it is found at the end of nouns, e.g. अंगुलमात्रम् ‘the breadth of a finger,’ क्रोशमात्रे ‘at the distance of a koś,’ रेखामात्रमपि ‘even the breadth of a line’ R.i.17, क्षणमात्रम् ‘the space of a moment,’ निमेषमात्रात् ‘in an instant’ R.iii.61); 2. the full measure of anything, the entire class of things, the whole, the totality, e.g. प्राणिमात्रम् ‘the whole class of sentient beings’; 3. the one thing and no more; (in this sense, the word is translatable by ‘only, just, mere, even,’ e.g. वर्णमात्रेण कृष्णः ‘black only in colour,’ Megh.i.49, R.xii.10, M.viiii.20, ix.106).(When joined to a past passive participle, मात्र has the sense of ‘as soon as,’ ‘no sooner than’ e.g. प्रविष्टमात्र एव तत्रभवति Sak.iii.)", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["मात्रं", "मात्रः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["mAtraM", "mAtraH"]}, {"id": "mAtrA", "headword": "मात्रा", "headword_slp1": "mAtrA", "fold": "matra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "मात्र (I) a. (f. त्री or त्रा) An affix added to nouns to denote ‘measuring as much as,’ ‘reaching as far as’ e.g. ऊरुमात्र.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "मात्रा f. (the word is used in all the senses of मात्र) 1. A unit of measure; 2. the correct measure; 3. a moment; 4. a particle, an atom; 5. a small portion, a little, पिंडेन्य्स्त्वल्पिकां मात्रांसमादाय M.iii.219, R.iii.11; 6. an element; 7. the material world; 8. money, wealth, substance; 9. an ornament, a jewel; 10. the upper limb of the Nāgarī characters; 11. retinue; 12. a syllabic instant (in prosody).(का or कियती मात्रा ‘of what account or consideration,’ e.g. गजेति का मात्रा मम.)", 